e HUD / weapon might disappear\n- \"Error\" sound when trying to plant in a restricted area is now played\nto everyone\n- Added Cvar `ghoststrike_timeover_forceplant`. When set to \"1\"\nGhostStrike will attempt to enforce a bombplant when the time is about\nto run out (Or, rightfully give the round win to the CT's if its not\nfeasible). This is an attempt to prevent trolling kiddys. (BETA !!,\ndefault off)", "created_at": "2016-11-15T03:40:58Z", "repo": "CSGO-GhostStrike", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "873274f857a4c4de1394aee104f8edc8f5567564", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2016-11-01T01:49:24Z", "repo": "CSGO-GhostStrike", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "d4da44000114902aa89f1348d2e368c98b55d8bb", "message": "Better translation for Hermany", "created_at": "2016-10-31T20:14:49Z", "repo": "CSGO-GhostStrike", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bb6ea17687404595f5636d3cea0259879a96d91c", "message": "Update to 1.2.3\n\n- Added HP bonus for CT's when theres more than 5 T's (Bonus per extra T\nconfigureable via Cvar `ghoststrike_ct_hp_bonus`)\n- Added Cvar `ghoststrike_plant_block_radius` which configures the\nradius in Units a Terrorist cannot re-plant the bomb to previously\nplanted bomb(s). Setting it to 0 turns it off\n- Added new Translation `Cannot_Plant_Region` defining the Message that\npops up when you try to plant in the forbidden area", "created_at": "2016-10-31T20:04:43Z", "repo": "CSGO-GhostStrike", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "1ba85e708fc6582ad29c71449ad0660ea4fcdad5", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2016-10-27T14:42:00Z", "repo": "CSGO-GhostStrike", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "844b45bca4ec6af5e7f3108318576a7c91976e5b", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2016-10-27T14:41:26Z", "repo